Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 20:33:43 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [prplmesh] support wireless bSTA DPP onboarding

Complete wireless bSTA DPP onboarding across the agent and the WHM HAL.

The WHM HAL side implements the DPP endpoint RPCs for bootstrap generation, extra configuration, persisted credentials, and chirping. It also implements the DPP-over-TCP relay lifecycle and per-BSS DPP AKM/CCE credential handling.

The agent side now keeps bootstrap state per bSTA radio, re-registers bootstrap data after HAL recreation, clears stale event handlers before WPA re-attach, retries setup, uses bounded DPP recovery windows, and schedules chirps with the radio-owned bootstrap ID. Successful provisioning stops the retry cycle.

Change-Id: If890c238acaf4657f0e6073aebe6529504317af2

Signed-off-by: Sandeep Tomer <stomer@qti.qualcomm.com>
